  "_about": "How Stingy Reputation Scanner asks each security vendor for a review (false positive). One entry per vendor; the key is the vendor name in lower case without spaces or punctuation (it matches the start of the name VirusTotal uses). form: the false positive form, or an e-mail address. method: form (open it; copy decides what goes on the clipboard), prefill (the form takes the fields in \"fill\" from its address), email (a ready e-mail opens). fill: form field name -> value, with {site} {domain} {my_email} {my_name} {my_company} {detection} {classification} {alert_id} {text}; empty values are left out. copy: url (the site address), text (the ready-made description), none. advice: shown under the link. alert_id: show the Alert ID box. captcha, account, tested: what we know about the form. A copy of this file in the extension's data folder (/usr/local/psa/var/modules/stingyscan/data/vendors.json) is used instead of this one.",
